property_value: IAO:0000602 "(iff (ZeroDimensionalContinuantFiatBoundary a) (and (ContinuantFiatBoundary a) (exists (b) (and (ZeroDimensionalSpatialRegion b) (forall (t) (locatedInAt a b t)))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [031-001] " xsd:string {IAO:0010000="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/031-001"}

